WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Now a workload runs against PostgreSQL.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Start Workload prepares the pgbench schema. The run has a 60-minute limit, so it stops by itself, and evidence is saved every 10 seconds.

3
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The Workloads page follows the run as it happens.

4
00:00:35.000 --> 00:01:31.000
pgbench drives about 200 to 390 transactions a second through the primary, with two replicas streaming. The amber band marks the earlier recovery test.

5
00:01:31.000 --> 00:02:30.000
In New Relic, the workload dashboard picks up the load.

6
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:48.000
Operations per second, connections, CPU and memory all rise with the workload.

